# Butler Routes - Westfall rares and treasures companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# An opportunistic sweep for the 14 confirmed rares and the fixed world containers
# of Westfall. Run it in its own Polestar tab at the end of the core route or
# standalone. EVERY goal is optional: a rare that is not up never holds the route.
# Spawn points, levels and loot are the local Forever game data (questie-forever);
# respawn timers are unconfirmed anywhere, so none are stated. Named mobs that are
# core-route quest objectives or quest givers (Old Murk-Eye, the Defias Messenger,
# the Defias Traitor, the captains, Alba Fairmoon, Ozwin Ironsprocket and the rest)
# are NOT here: the core guide covers their quests. See
# docs/westfall-companions-inventory.md for the full inventory this guide was built
# against.
guide butler-routes-completionist/westfall-rares
title Westfall - Rares & Treasures
levels 9-18
zone Westfall
faction Alliance
category Collectibles
folder Companions
keywords westfall, rares, treasures, companions
coords live
version 1

step Master Digger — the Jangolode Mine

  goto 46.42,19.06
  kill 1424 optional
  collect 6205 "Burrowing Shovel" optional
  collect 6206 "Rock Chipper" optional
  note Level 15 rare kobold, flagged rare in the data.
  note Also drops ordinary greens (Calico Tunic, Wooden Buckler); respawn timer unconfirmed.

