  goto 49.47,18.99
  kill 502 optional
  note Level 15 rare.
  note Also drops ordinary greens (Calico Tunic, Calico Shoes); respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Slark — the northern shore

  goto 47.01,10.94
  kill 519 optional
  collect 3188 "Coral Claymore" optional
  collect 6180 "Slarkskin" optional
  note Level 15 rare murloc, flagged rare in the data; not tameable. Also carries Captain Sander's Treasure Map (item 1357), which starts the core quest Captain Sander's Hidden Treasure (136); the core route covers that quest.
  note Also drops ordinary greens (Calico Tunic, Wooden Buckler); respawn timer unconfirmed.

